      "location": "Raw PDF page 26, printed page 4, Section 1.1.1, equation (1.10)",
      "anchor": "for any two points x_1 and x_2",
      "observation": "The integral conservation law is d/dt ∫_[x_1]^[x_2] q(x,t) dx = f(q(x_1,t)) − f(q(x_2,t))."
    },
    {
      "location": "Raw PDF page 26, printed page 4, paragraph immediately following equation (1.10)",
