    },
    {
      "location": "Raw PDF page 27, printed page 5, Section 1.2, first paragraph",
      "anchor": "finite volume methods, which are based on the integral form (1.10)",
      "observation": "The surrounding discussion reinforces the distinction by basing finite volume methods on integrals over cells when solutions contain discontinuities."
    }
