    "binders": [
      "Inherited unknown: q : R × R → R^m, with x the spatial variable, t time, and m the number of components; no particular m is selected for the integral-law discussion. [Printed p. 1, paragraph following (1.1); printed p. 4, paragraph following (1.10).]",
