      "The inherited framework is time-dependent, one-dimensional hyperbolic conservation laws with potentially vector-valued states. The constant-coefficient linear system on page 1 is an introductory case, not a restriction of the subsequent nonlinear discussion. [Printed p. 1, introduction surrounding (1.1); printed p. 4, opening paragraph.]",
